0 |
0 |
0 |
0 |
DT_NUMERIC |
0 |
Greater than 0 and less than or equal to 28, and less than Precision. |
Greater than or equal to 1 and less than or equal to 38. |
0 |
DT_BYTES |
Greater than 0. |
0 |
0 |
0 |
